      "url": "https://www.near.org/blog/near-foundation-joins-x402-foundation",
      "full_sentence": "NEAR is building infrastructure that intends to bring them together as one system that works alongside x402: universal liquidity and confidential execution through NEAR Intents, private inference and a secure agent harness through NEAR AI, agent-to-agent discovery and coordination through the NEAR Agent Market, and scalable, quantum-resistant settlement through NEAR Protocol.",
